<title>ITALY: Italy plans 7-yr Swiss franc bond - Treasury.</title>
<headline>Italy plans 7-yr Swiss franc bond - Treasury.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy plans to issue a seven-year Swiss franc bond, the Treasury said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said Credit Suisse First Boston would act as bookrunners.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 6782505</p>
</text>
